          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "тропа (tropá) is an old Slavic word, usually linked with a root for stamping the feet: a path trodden by feet. EtymDB lists it without a source, so the line is hedged."
            }
          ]
